<title>BELGIUM: EU to vote on Portuguese cane sugar rules on Jan 8.</title>
<headline>EU to vote on Portuguese cane sugar rules on Jan 8.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will decide a Portuguese reguest for a change in the rules governing cane sugar imports when it next meets on January 8, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Portuguese say that the time allowed for getting certificates to the port of entry needs to be extended for cane sugar shipments from Brazil,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>At the meeting the committee will also decide tender refunds and molasses duties, the official said.</p>
</text>
